  "description": "<p>Made By Coopers is a modern apothecary crafting natural products to boost and balance mental and emotional wellbeing.</p>\r\n<p>Each and every product has been formulated and developed by founders Clare and Darren Cooper, who previously worked on their own anxiety and sleep problems in a holistic way and became experts in aromatherapy and mindful rituals. It was through the knowledge learned on their own healing journeys (which included a 3 month stint in India), that they were able to create their little bottles of natural solutions to common wellbeing problems and in particular sleep and anxiety</p>\r\n<p>Our award-winning ritualistic products include essential oil blends, natural room mists, pillow mists, candles, relaxation aids and bath &amp; body products. Every product has a different aromatherapy benefit which help to boost energy levels, restore balance, uplift moods, ease anxiety and stress, and aid sleep.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
